\ LARGEST.SEQ   Return the largest element of an array of words
\                                                       F-PC native port

\ Native port: high level (was an 8086 CODE word); elements are cells,
\ compared unsigned. Returns the address and value of the first largest
\ element, or a1 0 if all are zero.
: largest       ( a1 n1 --- a2 n2 )
                >r dup 0 rot r> cells bounds
                ?do     i @ over u>
                        if      2drop i i @
                        then
          cell +loop    ;
